OL,3,GNEWSAPlaques placed on homes to bring
OL,4,Awar stories to life
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoger Webster never met his father, who
OL,7,Fdied days before he was born in 1942.
OL,9,FHedley Webster, 30, boarded a ship
OL,10,Ftrying to escape the Japanese invasion
OL,11,Fof Singapore, when the vessel was sunk
OL,12,Fand he was declared missing, presumed
OL,13,Fdead. He never returned home.
OL,15,FA red plaque in memory of the RAF
OL,16,FVolunteer Reserve airman is one of
OL,17,Fdozens placed around his home town of
OL,18,FStapleford in Nottinghamshire.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
