OL,3,GNEWSAPlaques placed on homes to bring
OL,4,Awar stories to life
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd Roger feels it is a fitting tribute
OL,7,Fto the memory of his father and all
OL,8,Fthose from the town who lost their
OL,9,Flives during World War Two.
